Package: bayesvis
Type: Package
Title: Extended Bayesian Visualization Diagnostics
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R:
    person("Bayesvis", "Contributors",
           email = "bayesvis@example.com",
           role  = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: An extension prototype for the 'bayesplot' package providing
    advanced Bayesian visualization capabilities. Implements prior-to-posterior
    shrinkage diagnostics (mcmc_shrinkage()), LOO probability integral transform
    plots (ppc_loo_pit(), ppc_loo_pit_qq()), rank-based ECDF diagnostics
    (mcmc_rank_ecdf()), and posterior predictive coverage plots (ppc_coverage()).
    All plots return 'ggplot2' objects and integrate with 'bayesplot' themes
    and color schemes, making bayesvis a natural companion to the bayesplot
    workflow.
